### ─── PropertyLoop Users Endpoints ──────────────────────────────────────────
### First login to get tokens
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{buyerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{buyerPassword}}"
}

### ═══ 1. Get profile ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 2. Update profile ═══
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tunde Akinola",
  "phone": "+2348012345678",
  "location": "Lekki, Lagos",
  "bio": "First-time buyer looking for a family home in Lekki"
}

### ═══ 3. Get settings ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 4. Update settings ═══
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notifEmail": true,
  "notifSms": false,
  "notifMessages": true,
  "notifPriceAlerts": true,
  "notifMarketing": false,
  "profileVisible": true,
  "shareActivity": false,
  "language": "English",
  "currency": "NGN"
}
